OneConfig uses the following third-party material in its test suite; none of it is shipped in the app itself.
The one exception is the Jersey 15 font, the last entry, which is embedded in the app.

pan-os-codegen (Palo Alto Networks), MIT License
  https://github.com/PaloAltoNetworks/pan-os-codegen, commit ee44e33cf576db65645123c4dc6eff6407e040ac
  Its YAML config specs are fetched by tests/syntax/build_panspec.sh to check generated PAN-OS syntax.

Iron-Skillet (Palo Alto Networks), MIT License
  https://github.com/PaloAltoNetworks/iron-skillet, branches panos_v8.0 to panos_v11.0
  Command shapes (values replaced by V) are in tests/syntax/vendor_panos_shapes.txt.

Fortinet FortiOS Ansible collection (ansible-galaxy-fortios-collection), GNU GPL 3.0
  https://github.com/fortinet-ansible-dev/ansible-galaxy-fortios-collection, commit 5174d341626cb099a079b18276906f3f91f4a110
  Fetched by tests/syntax/build_fosspec.sh into a local cache to check generated FortiOS syntax. Not copied into, linked
  with or shipped in OneConfig.

ntc-templates (Network to Code), Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/networktocode/ntc-templates
  tests/fixtures/fortios/get_system_status.txt is adapted from its FortiOS 7.4.8 test sample (hostname, model, serial changed).

Batfish, Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/batfish/batfish
  Its ANTLR grammars are compiled by tests/syntax/build_parser.sh to check NX-OS, EOS, Junos and ASA syntax.

STIG Manager client modules (Naval Undersea Warfare Center Division Newport), MIT License
  https://github.com/NUWCDIVNPT/stig-manager-client-modules, commit d835d6e3342408b3cf146c90554997cfda22ea64
  Fetched by tests/build_stigmanager.sh to check that STIG Manager reads OneConfig's checklists. Not shipped.

DISA STIG content (rule IDs, titles, severities in oneconfig/stig/catalog.json; check and fix text, discussions and CCIs
in oneconfig/stig/rules.json.gz) is a U.S. Government work in the public domain.

Jersey 15 (The Soft Type Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://github.com/scfried/soft-type-jersey
  A Latin subset is embedded in oneconfig/ui/index.html for the "Pixel tactics" theme. Licence text: https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/
